{"text":"<p><span>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gwLaf5-qefU</span></p><p><br /></p><p>### 69-1. Upādānaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-46-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26149.6326390782\">7:15:49</span> 1. Noupādānaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca noupādāno kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-46-1</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26159.572353832154\">7:15:59</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26164.66226779782\">7:16:04</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26169.74985585695\">7:16:09</span> 2. Upādānaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca upādāno akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Upādānaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca noupādāno akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Upādānaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca upādāno akusalo ca noupādāno akusalo ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) ^7-46-2</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26200.348619047683\">7:16:40</span> Noupādānaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca noupādāno akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26211.329214035763\">7:16:51</span> Upādānaṃ akusalañca noupādānaṃ akusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca upādāno akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26227.38522394564\">7:17:07</span> 3. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava (sabbattha nava), avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-46-3</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26234.071240979974\">7:17:14</span> 4. Noupādānaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca noupādāno akusalo dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-46-4</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26243.502578854088\">7:17:23</span> 5. Nahetuyā ekaṃ, naadhipatiyā nava, napurejāte nava…pe… nakamme tīṇi, navipāke nava, navippayutte nava (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārādi vitthāretabbo). ^7-46-5</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26261.84715282262\">7:17:41</span> 6. Upādāno akusalo dhammo upādānassa akusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-46-6</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26271.796698326158\">7:17:51</span> 7. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava (noupādānamūlake tīṇi, sahajātādhipati), anantare nava…pe… nissaye nava, upanissaye nava, āsevane nava, kamme tīṇi (noupādānamūlake), āhāre tīṇi, indriye tīṇi, jhāne tīṇi, magge nava, sampayutte nava, atthiyā nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-46-7</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26299.29657693992\">7:18:19</span> 8. Noupādānaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca noupādāno abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-46-8</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26309.29338916308\">7:18:29</span> 9. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-46-9</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26314.882884908446\">7:18:34</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 70-1. Upādāniyaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-46a-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-46b-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26319.9137998827\">7:18:39</span> 10. Upādāniyaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca upādāniyo kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-46b-10</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26328.313321951362\">7:18:48</span> Anupādāniyaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca anupādāniyo kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26337.592815925615\">7:18:57</span> 11. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ. Lokiyalokuttaradukakusalasadisaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… pañhāvārampi vitthāretabbaṃ.) ^7-46b-11</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26349.895015205995\">7:19:09</span> 12. Upādāniyaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca upādāniyo akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-46b-12</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26362.24174005436\">7:19:22</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26367.61784700286\">7:19:27</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26372.416884799728\">7:19:32</span> 13. Upādāniyaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca upādāniyo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-46b-13</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26385.69065408583\">7:19:45</span> Anupādāniyaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca anupādāniyo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Anupādāniyaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca upādāniyo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Anupādāniyaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca upādāniyo abyākato ca anupādāniyo abyākato ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26419.658513263214\">7:20:19</span> Upādāniyaṃ abyākatañca anupādāniyaṃ abyākatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca upādāniyo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26432.072111266076\">7:20:32</span> 14. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe dve…pe… āsevane ekaṃ…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ. Lokiyadukaabyākatasadisaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… pañhāvārampi vitthāretabbaṃ). ^7-46b-14</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 71-1. Upādānasampayuttaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-46c-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-46d-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26446.13529493992\">7:20:46</span> 15. Upādānavippayuttaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca upādānavippayutto kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-46d-15</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26459.503294965667\">7:20:59</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26464.65270277398\">7:21:04</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26469.788121062942\">7:21:09</span> 16. Upādānasampayuttaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca upādānasampayutto akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-46d-16</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26481.150822705316\">7:21:21</span> Upādānavippayuttaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca upādānavippayutto akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… dve.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26492.307772068663\">7:21:32</span> Upādānasampayuttaṃ akusalañca upādānavippayuttaṃ akusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca upādānasampayutto akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26505.56181897139\">7:21:45</span> 17. Hetuyā cha, ārammaṇe cha (sabbattha cha), avigate cha (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-46d-17</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26511.243275248908\">7:21:51</span> Nahetuyā ekaṃ, naadhipatiyā cha…pe… nakamme cattāri, navipāke cha, navippayutte cha (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārādi vitthāretabbo).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26523.08689600286\">7:22:03</span> 18. Upādānasampayutto akusalo dhammo upādānasampayuttassa akusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-46d-18</p><p><br /></p><p>Upādānavippayutto akusalo dhammo upādānavippayuttassa akusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… dve.</p><p><br /></p><p>Upādānasampayutto akusalo ca upādānavippayutto akusalo ca dhammā upādānasampayuttassa akusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26536.225646041963\">7:22:16</span> 19. Hetuyā cha, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava (upādānasampayuttamūlake tīṇi, sahajātādhipati, upādānavippayutte ekaṃ), anantare nava, samanantare nava, sahajāte cha, aññamaññe cha, nissaye cha, upanissaye nava, āsevane nava, kamme cattāri, āhāre cattāri, indriye cattāri, jhāne cattāri, magge cattāri, sampayutte cha, atthiyā cha, natthiyā nava, vigate nava, avigate cha (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-46d-19</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26574.787169934196\">7:22:54</span> 20. Upādānavippayuttaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca upādānavippayutto abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-46d-20</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26586.343173894144\">7:23:06</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26591.659689008582\">7:23:11</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 72-1. Upādānaupādāniyaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-46e-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-46f-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26596.70113474966\">7:23:16</span> 21. Upādāniyañceva no ca upādānaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca upādāniyo ceva no ca upādāno kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-46f-21</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26610.358859040054\">7:23:30</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26615.48182425368\">7:23:35</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26620.559529010014\">7:23:40</span> 22. Upādānañceva upādāniyañca akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca upādāno ceva upādāniyo ca akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-46f-22</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26632.93910089319\">7:23:52</span> Upādāniyañceva no ca upādānaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca upādāniyo ceva no ca upādāno akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26648.423887193596\">7:24:08</span> Upādānañceva upādāniyaṃ akusalañca upādāniyañceva no ca upādānaṃ akusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca upādāno ceva upādāniyo ca akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26666.604271756336\">7:24:26</span> 23. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ. Imaṃ gamanaṃ upādānadukaakusalasadisaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… pañhāvārampi vitthāretabbaṃ). ^7-46f-23</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26679.947614166893\">7:24:39</span> 24. Upādāniyañceva no ca upādānaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca upādāniyo ceva no ca upādāno abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-46f-24</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26701.898376786376\">7:25:01</span> 25. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-46f-25</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26706.65711309012\">7:25:06</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 73-1. Upādānaupādānasampayuttaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-46g-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-46h-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26711.461173377178\">7:25:11</span> 26. Upādānañceva upādānasampayuttañca akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca upādāno ceva upādānasampayutto ca akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-46h-26</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26726.63259288985\">7:25:26</span> Upādānasampayuttañceva no ca upādānaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca upādānasampayutto ceva no ca upādāno akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26736.652137130175\">7:25:36</span> Upādānañceva upādānasampayuttaṃ akusalañca upādānasampayuttañceva no ca upādānaṃ akusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca upādāno ceva upādānasampayutto ca akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26757.688270330447\">7:25:57</span> 27. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). (Imaṃ gamanaṃ upādānadukaakusalasadisaṃ. Idha pana hetupaccayā idaṃ nānaṃ. Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha nava.) ^7-46h-27</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 74-1. Upādānavippayuttaupādāniyaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-46i-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-46j-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26781.822392273705\">7:26:21</span> 28. Upādānavippayuttaṃ upādāniyaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca upādānavippayutto upādāniyo kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-46j-28</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26794.56407617357\">7:26:34</span> Upādānavippayuttaṃ anupādāniyaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca upādānavippayutto anupādāniyo kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26801.34901313113\">7:26:41</span> 29. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ. Lokiyadukakusalasadisaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… pañhāvārampi vitthāretabbaṃ). ^7-46j-29</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26815.10134683826\">7:26:55</span> 30. Upādānavippayuttaṃ upādāniyaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca upādānavippayutto upādāniyo akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (sabbattha ekaṃ). ^7-46j-30</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26833.630441216676\">7:27:13</span> Upādānavippayuttaṃ upādāniyaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca upādānavippayutto upādāniyo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26846.459418030518\">7:27:26</span> Upādānavippayuttaṃ anupādāniyaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca upādānavippayutto anupādāniyo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26861.465367987792\">7:27:41</span> Upādānavippayuttaṃ upādāniyaṃ abyākatañca upādānavippayuttaṃ anupādāniyaṃ abyākatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca upādānavippayutto upādāniyo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26879.69193377112\">7:27:59</span> 31. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe dve…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ. Lokiyadukaabyākatasadisaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… pañhāvārampi sabbattha vitthāretabbaṃ). ^7-46j-31</p><p><br /></p><p>Upādānagocchakakusalattikaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p></p>","media-time":26920.5626}